<h1>TReCaptcha Samples</h1>

<h2>Validating ReCAPTCHA v1</h2>

Google has retired reCAPTCHA v1, so this sample cannot verify a response. Use <tt>TReCaptcha2</tt> instead; see the <a href="?page=Controls.Samples.TReCaptcha2.Home">TReCaptcha2 sample</a>.

